{"id":"en_secret-tycoon-kin","title":"Secret Tycoon Kin","titleEn":"Secret Tycoon Kin","description":"Si Alicia ay nagtago ng kanyang ugnayan sa pinuno ng Zenith Group at pumasok bilang junior sales associate sa Horizon Firm. Sa pamamagitan ng sipag, nakamit niya ang pinakamataas na benta. Ngunit ninakaw ni Jaden ang kanyang mga tagumpay at ipinatanggal siya sa trabaho. Nagbalik si Alicia bilang awtorisadong kinatawan ng Zenith sa isang seremonya ng paglagda, kung saan natanggap ng mga may kasalanan ang nararapat na parusa. Ang mga pangyayaring ito ay masusubaybayan sa Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/secret-tycoon-kin/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/secret-tycoon-kin/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Secret Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtn2i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_secret-tycoon-kin_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtn2i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-tycoon-kin_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtn2i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-tycoon-kin_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtn2i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-tycoon-kin_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtn2i/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_secret-tycoon-kin_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5